---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Hyphos handles your data.">

  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 sm:pt-40 sm:pb-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-12">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Overview</h2>
          <p>
            Hyphos is an organizational intelligence platform. We take the privacy and security of your data seriously. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">When you use our website, we may collect:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm">
            <li>Information you provide directly (name, email, company) when contacting us</li>
            <li>Basic analytics data (page views, referrer) via privacy-respecting analytics</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            When you use the Hyphos platform, data processing is governed by your organization's agreement with us, which includes detailed data handling provisions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">How we use your information</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm">
            <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide early access</li>
            <li>To improve our website and understand how visitors use it</li>
            <li>To send you relevant product updates (only with your consent)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Data security</h2>
          <p>
            We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information. Platform data is encrypted in transit and at rest, with full audit logging and provenance tracking built into the architecture.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. You can opt out of communications at any time. For any privacy-related requests, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@hyphos.io" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">privacy@hyphos.io</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For questions about this privacy policy, email <a href="mailto:privacy@hyphos.io" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">privacy@hyphos.io</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
